Honesty packs: ../ooda/bootstrap/*.oot (no RESIDUAL_PACKS.oot file)
Std count today: 39 .oo files under ../ooda/std, 855 in std/

How to re-prove
  cd ../ooda
  export PURE_NO_ARC=0 PURE_SKIP_CHECK=1
  OODAC_BIN=./bootstrap/seed/oodac bash bootstrap/oodac_pure_build oodac/main.oo oodac/oodac
  OODAC_BIN=./oodac/oodac bash bootstrap/oodac_pure_build oodac/main.oo oodac/oodac
  ./oodac/oodac check scripts/ci_product.oo

  Seed emit alone is a working compiler at ~0.47 GiB check RAM.
  The second pass uses that host as emitter. Slim RAM is ~0.31 GiB and emit works.
  Slim two-stage emits c_emit_ty.oo, emit-llvm, and passes all product rails.

CI honesty
  `oodac check scripts/ci_product.oo` is check-only.
  It typechecks the product rails. It does not emit, gcc, or run those rails.
  Official rebuild is `bash bootstrap/oodac_pure_build` (host script: starts gcc and the seed).
